### 2.4 Verification plan (instruments named)
- Execute checklist: (1) cut segment.mp4 from source.mp4 at 28.5–36.5 s (window ±0.5 handles), libx264/yuv420p+AAC faststart, ffprobe filed; (2) build recreation.html (CONFIG at top, pure stateAt, window.__T232 exposed); (3) build comparison.html (shared controls, video.currentTime − 0.5 s handle offset → build ms, labels as charged, phone stacking @media ≤560px); (4) own checks §5 legs 1–3.
